sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Клиент
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant TR as TaskRuntime
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant WS as WebSocket Manager
    participant VD as VideoDownloader
    participant WO as WhisperOrchestrator
    participant WW as WhisperWorker
    participant LLM as LLM API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>API: POST /api/process-video {url, topic, level}
    API->>Redis: SET task:{id} {status: pending, progress: 0}
    API->>DB: INSERT processing_tasks (id, url, status=pending)
    API->>TR: enqueue({task_id, url, topic, level, kind=video})
    API-->>Client: {task_id, status: "started"}

    Note over TR,WS: Воркер забирает задачу из asyncio.Queue

    TR->>Redis: SET progress=5, step=downloading
    TR->>WS: send_progress(client_id, {progress: 5})
    WS-->>Client: WS {status: downloading, progress: 5}

    TR->>VD: download_video_audio(url, task_id)
    VD->>VD: detect_platform(url)
    Note over VD: YouTube: 3 стратегии форматов
    VD->>VD: yt-dlp стратегия 1 — bestaudio/best
    alt Формат недоступен
        VD->>VD: yt-dlp стратегия 2 — best[acodec!=none]
        VD->>VD: yt-dlp стратегия 3 — worstaudio/worst
    end
    VD-->>TR: {audio_path, title, subtitles, duration, platform}

    TR->>Redis: SET progress=20, step=downloaded
    TR->>WS: send_progress(client_id, {progress: 20})

    TR->>WO: transcribe_audio(audio_path, task_id, lang=ru)
    WO->>WO: get_available_worker()
    WO->>WW: POST /transcribe-path?audio_path=...&language=ru
    Note over WW: faster-whisper large-v3, таймаут 2 часа
    WW-->>WO: {text, segments[{start, end, text}]}
    WO-->>TR: транскрипт + сегменты с тайм-кодами

    TR->>Redis: SET progress=60, step=transcribed
    TR->>WS: send_progress(client_id, {progress: 60})

    TR->>LLM: POST extract_questions_from_transcript(transcript)
    Note over LLM: Цепочка: OpenRouter → Gemini → Groq
    LLM-->>TR: [{question, topic, difficulty, timecode}]
    TR->>TR: filter_low_quality_questions()
    TR->>TR: deduplicate_questions()

    TR->>Redis: SET progress=85, step=extracted
    TR->>WS: send_progress(client_id, {progress: 85})

    TR->>DB: INSERT processed_videos (video_id, url, title, platform)
    loop Для каждого вопроса
        TR->>DB: INSERT/LINK questions (upsert)
        TR->>DB: INSERT question_video (question_id, video_id)
        TR->>DB: INSERT question_timecodes (question_id, video_id, timecode)
    end
    TR->>TR: invalidate_similarity_cache()
    TR->>DB: UPDATE processing_tasks SET status=completed
    TR->>Redis: SET progress=100, status=completed
    TR->>WS: send_progress(client_id, {status: completed, count: N})
    WS-->>Client: WS {type: completed, questions_count: N}

    TR->>TR: cleanup_temp_files(audio_path)
